Create a modern “Our Work” section for a website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

Requirements:

Display projects in a horizontal slider (carousel) layout
The slider should be automatic (auto-scroll) and loop continuously
Use a curved / 3D perspective carousel effect (like a rotating gallery)
Each item should be a card/box design with:
Image
Title
Category (e.g., Digital Marketing)
Hover effect (scale or glow)
Center item should appear larger, side items slightly smaller (depth effect)
Smooth transitions and animations
Fully responsive (mobile + desktop)
Use clean modern UI (dark theme preferred)

Bonus:

Add navigation arrows or dots
Pause on hover
Use CSS transform (scale, rotateY) for 3D effect# Logs
